    "voice": "produce_events/101500002/1015001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大崎甜花さん、ですね\r\n今日はよろしくお願いします",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010020,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ひゃっ！\r\n……は、はい……よろしくお願いします……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500002/1015001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えーと……ごめんね\r\n驚かせちゃったかな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010030,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "い、いえ……\r\nあの……",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500002/1015001010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010040,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花……あんまり、他の人と話さないから……\r\nちょっと、びっくりしちゃっただけ……です……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500002/1015001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなんだ。でもオーディションだからって\r\nあんまり緊張せずに、楽しく話してもらえばいいからね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010050,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "楽しく話す……\r\nえ、えっと……頑張ります……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500002/1015001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それで、大崎さんはどうしてアイドルになろうと\r\n思ったのかな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010060,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "えっと……甜花はアイドルって……\r\nよくわかんないけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500002/1015001010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010070,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "なーちゃんが、一緒にアイドルになろうって……\r\n言ってくれたから……です……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500002/1015001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なーちゃん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010080,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あ、えっと……なーちゃんは……甜花の妹で……\r\n甘奈ちゃん、だから……なーちゃんって、呼んでる……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500002/1015001010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（妹……書類に双子の妹がいると書いてあったな\r\nあの子のことか）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなんだ。妹さんの言葉でアイドルになろうって\r\n思えるぐらい、妹さんのことが好きなんだね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010090,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "はい……なーちゃんは……いつも優しくて、元気で……\r\n甜花、大好き……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500002/1015001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いい子なんだね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010100,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……\r\n甜花、アイドルなんて……できるのかなって、思うけど……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500002/1015001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010110,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "でもなーちゃん、あんなふうに、言ってくれたから……\r\nなーちゃんのためにも、頑張ろうって……思います……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500002/1015001010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（妹さんのことを話すときの笑顔……\r\nこの笑顔を見てるとこっちまで楽しくなってくるな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（周りから魅力を引き出してあげれば\r\nすごいアイドルになるのかもしれない！）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、君は合格だ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010120,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "え……本当……？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500002/1015001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010130,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花が……アイドル……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500002/1015001010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、俺が君のプロデューサーだ\r\nよろしく、甜花さん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010140,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "は、はい……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500002/1015001010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010150,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花……頑張りましゅ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500002/1015001010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015001010160,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あ、頑張ります……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
